00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.978 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
Tax day is coming up.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.615
