[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you, Jimmy.
Nice to be here.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:16.342
-Now, Mark, April 17th is right
around the corner.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.111 size:81% position:41%
What are tips you have
