00:01:21.815 --> 00:01:26.252
-That's a good question,
Jimmy. Eh, don't worry about it.

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.554 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.554 --> 00:01:29.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sorry. What?
-Yeah.

00:01:29.622 --> 00:01:32.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't worry about doing
your taxes.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:35.995 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:38.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What are you talking about?
-Yeah, you know.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:42.168 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't do 'em. Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.137
-Right. Right. What do you mean,
