00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:54.180 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Nah, you're good.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:55.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm sorry. I'm just a little
unclear here.

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:57.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you guys have some sort of
system or process

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
