with their taxes?

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:03.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yes, we do, Jimmy.
Step one, yeah...

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.191 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Step two...

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:08.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-I'm so sorry, Mark.

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:09.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can you please explain
yourself further?

00:02:09.896 --> 00:02:11.197 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think we're all a little
unclear here.

00:02:11.197 --> 00:02:12.866
-Well, Jimmy, we here
at Bream and Hackett have found

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:16.402
